{'symbol': 'XRAY', 'date': '2023-05-24 16:30:00', 'title': 'DENTSPLY SIRONA DECLARES QUARTERLY CASH DIVIDEND', 'text': 'CHARLOTTE, N.C., MAY 24, 2023 (GLOBE NEWSWIRE) -- DENTSPLY SIRONA INC. (“DENTSPLY SIRONA”) (NASDAQ: XRAY), ANNOUNCED THAT ITS BOARD OF DIRECTORS DECLARED A QUARTERLY CASH DIVIDEND OF\xa0$0.14\xa0PER SHARE OF COMMON STOCK, AN INDICATED ANNUAL RATE OF\xa0$0.56\xa0PER SHARE. THE DIVIDEND IS PAYABLE ON JULY 14, 2023, TO HOLDERS OF RECORD AS OF JUNE 30, 2023.'}